OL,3,GNEWSAWill pigeon mural get its wings
OL,4,Aback?
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cafe owner is calling on the local
OL,7,Fcommunity to help him update its famous
OL,8,Fpigeon mural.
OL,10,FFor more than three decades a huge
OL,11,Fpicture of a pigeon with its wings
OL,12,Fspread wide featured on the side of the
OL,13,Fformer Bridge Bar on Bridge Street in
OL,14,FBanbury, Oxfordshire.
OL,16,FIn 2024, owner of the now Power Cup
OL,17,Fcafe Tomas Kolbus decided the old work
OL,18,Fneeded updating, so brought in artists
OL,19,Fto transform it, controversially
OL,20,Fpainting over the bird.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
