OL,3,GNEWSAWill pigeon mural get its wings
OL,4,Aback?
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe has now decided to involve the
OL,7,Fcommunity in redesigning the work to
OL,8,Fbetter reflect the town and possibly to
OL,9,Ffeature a new pigeon.
